"keep the Mac awake with the lid closed" = "在合盖时让 Mac 保持唤醒";
"switch closed-display mode with the session" = "随会话切换合盖模式";
"pause AWDL (turn off the Wi-Fi AirDrop/Handoff radio hops)" = "暂停 AWDL（关闭 AirDrop/Handoff 的 Wi-Fi 无线跳频）";
"macOS is asking for your administrator password to %@. The dialog may be titled “osascript”: that's Keepresso running the command, and nothing else is changed. To stop these prompts for good, install the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General)." = "macOS 正在请求你的管理员密码，以便%@。对话框标题可能为“osascript”：那是 Keepresso 在运行该命令，不会更改其他任何内容。若要彻底停止这些提示，请安装管理员助理（偏好设置 ▸ 通用）。";
"Keepresso keeps your Mac awake on your terms. It lives in the menu bar near the clock, with no Dock icon. Click its cup any time to start or stop." = "Keepresso 按你的规则让 Mac 保持唤醒。它位于菜单栏时钟旁，没有程序坞图标。随时点按它的杯子即可开始或停止。";
"Pick one to set up matching triggers, or keep it manual and add your own later. You can change this any time in Preferences." = "选择一项以设置相应的触发条件，或保持手动，稍后添加自己的。你可以随时在“偏好设置”中更改。";
"When on, the listed conditions control the session instead of the manual switch." = "开启后，列出的条件将取代手动开关来控制会话。";
"Activation is controlled by triggers.\nEdit them in Preferences." = "激活由触发条件控制。\n请在“偏好设置”中编辑它们。";
"Why each session started or stopped, newest first. Kept in memory; clears on relaunch." = "每个会话开始或停止的原因，最新的在前。保存在内存中，重新启动时清除。";
"Every app's live power assertions, not just Keepresso's, the same data pmset -g assertions prints." = "所有 App 的实时电源断言，不仅仅是 Keepresso 的，与 pmset -g assertions 打印的数据相同。";
"A system-wide keyboard shortcut that starts or stops keep-awake from any app. Needs at least one modifier key." = "一个全局键盘快捷键，可从任何 App 开始或停止保持唤醒。至少需要一个修饰键。";
"Lets the Mac sleep once battery charge drops below this level, even mid-session, so it doesn't run flat." = "当电量降到此水平以下时（即使在会话进行中）让 Mac 进入睡眠，以免电量耗尽。";
"Shows the remaining time next to the menu-bar icon during a timed session." = "在定时会话期间，于菜单栏图标旁显示剩余时间。";
"Starts a session as soon as Keepresso launches, using the default duration. Ignored while triggers are controlling activation." = "Keepresso 启动后立即以默认时长开始一个会话。当触发条件控制激活时将忽略此项。";
"Reopen the first-run welcome, with quick one-click setup for how you use your Mac." = "重新打开首次启动的欢迎界面，可按你使用 Mac 的方式一键快速设置。";
"Fires when a timed session expires, trigger conditions drop, or a low-battery pause kicks in, not when you stop it yourself. The action is off by default so a timed session never surprises you." = "在定时会话到期、触发条件不再满足或低电量暂停生效时触发，而不是在你自己停止时。该操作默认关闭，因此定时会话不会让你意外。";
"If that time already passed today, it means tomorrow." = "如果该时间今天已过，则表示明天。";
"Runs past midnight into the next day." = "跨过午夜延续到第二天。";
"Save your settings, triggers, and presets to a JSON file to back them up or move them to another Mac. Importing replaces your current configuration and ends any running session." = "将你的设置、触发条件和预设保存到 JSON 文件以进行备份或迁移到另一台 Mac。导入会替换当前配置并结束任何正在运行的会话。";
"Keeps the Mac awake while a partial-download file (.crdownload, .download, .part, and the like) exists in the chosen folder, then lets it sleep once the download finishes. Holds for 30 seconds between files in a batch." = "只要所选文件夹中存在未完成的下载文件（.crdownload、.download、.part 等），就让 Mac 保持唤醒；下载完成后让其睡眠。一批文件之间保持 30 秒。";
"Writes a tiny marker file on the chosen volume periodically to stop an external drive or NAS from spinning down." = "定期在所选宗卷上写入一个微小的标记文件，以防止外置硬盘或 NAS 停转。";
"For a Mac with no monitor: creates a higher-resolution display so Screen Sharing and VNC look crisp instead of a fuzzy 1920 × 1080. It uses a private macOS API, so treat it as experimental and expect it may break on a macOS update. A hardware HDMI or DisplayPort dummy plug is a no-software alternative." = "适用于没有显示器的 Mac：创建更高分辨率的显示器，让屏幕共享和 VNC 清晰显示，而不是模糊的 1920 × 1080。它使用了 macOS 私有 API，因此请将其视为实验性功能，并预期 macOS 更新可能使其失效。硬件 HDMI 或 DisplayPort 假负载是无需软件的替代方案。";
"Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag." = "使用电池时也保持唤醒；合盖时显示器会关闭。放入包中前请将其关闭。";
"The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "日历规则需要日历访问权限（系统设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性）";
"Wi-Fi rules need Location access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "Wi-Fi 规则需要定位访问权限（系统设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性）";
"Checks an always-on Mac (e.g. a headless Mac mini) needs. Keepresso can read these but can't change the system ones, so use the links and commands below." = "常开 Mac（例如无显示器的 Mac mini）所需的检查项。Keepresso 可读取这些项，但无法更改系统项，因此请使用下方的链接和命令。";
"macOS hops the Wi-Fi radio off-channel for AWDL about once a second, which shows up as ping spikes mid-game or mid-stream. Diagnose it here, and pause AWDL for the session if it's the culprit." = "macOS 大约每秒一次将 Wi-Fi 无线电切换到 AWDL 的其他信道，这会在游戏或串流中表现为 ping 尖峰。在此进行诊断，如果确为元凶，可在本次会话中暂停 AWDL。";
"Pings 1.1.1.1 five times a second for 10 seconds and checks whether latency spikes on AWDL's once-a-second cadence." = "以每秒五次的频率 ping 1.1.1.1 共 10 秒，并检查延迟是否按 AWDL 每秒一次的节奏出现尖峰。";
"Counts only while a game (or a cloud-gaming app) is the active window, not just running in the background. Keeps holding for 5 minutes after you switch away." = "仅在游戏（或云游戏 App）为活动窗口时计数，而不仅仅是在后台运行。切换离开后仍保持 5 分钟。";
"How long the pause lingers after the game stops being the active window, so a quick alt-tab doesn't flap the radios. Shorter brings AirDrop and Handoff back faster; longer rides out launchers and loading screens." = "游戏不再是活动窗口后暂停会持续多久，以免快速的 Alt-Tab 让无线电反复开关。更短能更快恢复 AirDrop 和 Handoff；更长则可平稳度过启动器和加载画面。";
"Posts a notification when a game is detected and AWDL pauses, and again when it resumes. A notice that your administrator password is needed is always sent (even behind a fullscreen game), regardless of this switch." = "在检测到游戏并暂停 AWDL 时发送通知，恢复时再次发送。无论此开关如何，都会始终发送需要管理员密码的提示（即使在全屏游戏后面）。";
"Also tells macOS you're active while a session runs, so remote-desktop sessions, meeting presence (Teams, Slack), and corporate idle-logout don't mark you away. A plain keep-awake doesn't reach those. It only steps in once you've been idle a few seconds, so it never nudges the pointer while you're using the Mac or gaming. Off by default; some managed Macs flag simulated activity." = "在会话运行时还会告知 macOS 你处于活跃状态，这样远程桌面会话、会议在线状态（Teams、Slack）和企业空闲注销就不会把你标记为离开。普通的保持唤醒无法做到这一点。它只在你空闲几秒后才介入，因此在你使用 Mac 或玩游戏时绝不会移动指针。默认关闭；某些受管理的 Mac 会标记模拟活动。";
"Install a small helper service so closed-display mode and AWDL pausing never ask for your password again. macOS will ask you to allow it in System Settings, once; nothing else changes." = "安装一个小型助理服务，让合盖模式和暂停 AWDL 不再向你索要密码。macOS 会请你在“系统设置”中允许它一次；其他一切不变。";
"One step left, in System Settings: under General ▸ Login Items & Extensions (“Login Items” on older macOS), find Keepresso in the “Allow in the Background” list and turn its switch ON. macOS asks for your administrator password once; this updates by itself when you're done." = "还差一步，在“系统设置”中：在“通用 ▸ 登录项与扩展”（较旧 macOS 上为“登录项”）中，于“允许在后台”列表内找到 Keepresso 并打开其开关。macOS 会索要一次管理员密码；完成后此项会自动更新。";
"Keeps running with the lid shut and no external display, on power or battery. The display itself still turns off when the lid closes (unless an external display is attached), so it's not lighting up uselessly inside the closed lid. Changing this flips a system setting (pmset disablesleep), so it stays in effect until you turn it off. On battery and closed it can still drain the battery over time, so don't leave it on in a bag. With “Only while brewing” on, Keepresso instead switches it on when a keep-awake session starts and back off when it ends or the app quits. Both need administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (see the top of this tab), otherwise macOS asks for your password (once per app run for “Only while brewing”)." = "在合盖且无外接显示器时，无论使用电源还是电池都会继续运行。合盖时显示器本身仍会关闭（除非连接了外接显示器），因此不会在合上的盖子内无谓地亮着。更改此项会切换一项系统设置（pmset disablesleep），因此在你将其关闭前会一直生效。在使用电池且合盖时，它仍可能随时间耗尽电量，所以不要在装入包中时保持开启。开启“仅在运行时”后，Keepresso 会改为在保持唤醒会话开始时打开它，并在会话结束或 App 退出时关闭。两者都需要管理员权限：安装了管理员助理时为静默执行（见本标签页顶部），否则 macOS 会索要你的密码（“仅在运行时”为每次 App 运行一次）。";
"Turns the pause on right now and keeps it on until you turn it off or quit Keepresso (it isn't tied to whether a keep-awake session is brewing). While it's on, AirDrop, Handoff, Sidecar, and Continuity Camera take a break, and the once-a-second lag spikes stop. Everything comes back the moment you turn it off or quit Keepresso; even if the app crashes, macOS is restored automatically. With the administrator helper installed the switch is always instant and silent; without it, macOS asks for your password once per launch (the system dialog may show “osascript”, which is Keepresso running the command)." = "立即开启暂停，并保持开启，直到你将其关闭或退出 Keepresso（它与是否正在进行保持唤醒会话无关）。开启期间，AirDrop、Handoff、随航（Sidecar）和连续互通相机会暂停，每秒一次的延迟尖峰也会停止。一旦你关闭它或退出 Keepresso，一切都会立即恢复；即使 App 崩溃，macOS 也会自动还原。安装了管理员助理时，此开关始终即时且静默；未安装时，macOS 每次启动会索要一次你的密码（系统对话框可能显示“osascript”，那是 Keepresso 在运行该命令）。";
"Watches for a game (or a cloud-gaming app like GeForce NOW) as the active window and pauses AWDL on its own, then lifts the pause a little after you switch away (the delay below). It only counts while the game is in front and in use, not just running in the background. Without the administrator helper, turning this on asks for your password once per app run, right now rather than mid-game; with the helper it never asks at all. No trigger setup needed: leave this on and forget it." = "监视游戏（或像 GeForce NOW 这样的云游戏 App）是否为活动窗口，并自行暂停 AWDL，然后在你切换离开后稍过一会儿解除暂停（见下方延迟）。它仅在游戏位于最前并在使用时计数，而不仅仅是在后台运行。在没有管理员助理的情况下，开启此项会在每次 App 运行时索要一次你的密码，是现在而非游戏进行中；有助理时则完全不询问。无需设置触发条件：保持开启并无需操心。";
"Helper installed. Closed-display mode and AWDL pausing work without password prompts." = "助理已安装。合盖模式和暂停 AWDL 无需密码提示即可工作。";
"Pause AWDL to steady your connection, and test your jitter, in Gaming & Streaming." = "在“游戏与串流”中暂停 AWDL 以稳定连接，并测试你的抖动。";
"A small system service that handles the privileged switches (closed-display mode below, AWDL pausing in Gaming & Streaming) for Keepresso, so no password prompts ever again: macOS asks once when you approve it under Login Items, and the approval survives restarts and updates. It can only flip those specific switches, everything it changes is restored if the app quits or crashes, and you can remove it here at any time. It also puts the keepresso command-line tool on your PATH (Homebrew installs already have it). After removal, System Settings can keep showing a stale Login Items row until macOS refreshes its list; the status shown here is the real one." = "一个小型系统服务，为 Keepresso 处理特权开关（下方的合盖模式、“游戏与串流”中的暂停 AWDL），从此不再有密码提示：当你在“登录项”中批准它时 macOS 会询问一次，且该批准在重启和更新后依然有效。它只能切换那些特定开关，它更改的一切都会在 App 退出或崩溃时还原，你可以随时在此移除它。它还会把 keepresso 命令行工具加入你的 PATH（Homebrew 安装已自带）。移除后，“系统设置”可能仍显示过时的登录项行，直到 macOS 刷新其列表；此处显示的状态才是真实的。";
